Icons
=====

lucide/
-------

The SVGs in `lucide/` are from Lucide 0.468.0
(https://github.com/lucide-icons/lucide), an outline icon set.

`star-filled.svg` is `star.svg` with the fill set to `currentColor` so a
bookmarked page can show a solid star. `restore.svg` is Lucide's `copy.svg`
(two overlapping rounded squares), used as the window restore glyph.

